    rdfs:label "Order: Main path states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the Main path path of the Order workflow, in order: OrderPaymentDue, OrderProcessing, OrderInTransit, OrderDelivered. A transition is legal between adjacent states. An order's status per schema.org OrderStatus: payment due, processing, in transit, delivered, with pickup, problem, cancellation and return." ;
